\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell What kind of despicable creature could do something like this to a child!? It makes me so mad! Whatever you need to do to make this right, honey, I'm with you all the way.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
