\par
Yes, it means we're going to have to get in a gondola, but try to resist the temptation to burst out singing, honey. This isn't the time...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Let's sneak up to that bridge in the middle of town and see if we can spot where they're keeping Erik.\par
\par
Be quiet as mice now, and use the buildings for cover\emdash the streets are crawling with soldiers!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
