\lquote Hey, can't you seee!\rquote  \f2\u9834?\f1\par
\par
\lquote I'm with the Luminaryyy!\rquote  \f2\u9834?\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
