\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Look at all these burly brawlers! They must all be here for the tournament! Colour me excited, honey!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10340 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Honey, I just\emdash CANNOT\emdash wait for this tournament to get started. As soon as I saw how everyone got paired up, I knew it was going to be a good one.\par
